            "review_title": "Review at Gia Ngu Express",
            "review_text": "June\nDuong Dong, Vietnam18 contributions\n0\nThe Quite Coner in Busy City!\nAug 2018 • Family\nFoods and drinks are the subjects I always love. Gia Ngu is not the so specticurlar place to eat and enjoy the landscape but it has actually good traditional Vietnamese foods and especially the way they serve us carefully, is an important element that I will comback this place soon. Clumsily, I and my young sister forgot chargers for our phones. However the manager stepped to us to support. Fortunately, he has many kinds of charger for us.\nThe price is also suitable for us to consider that we should choose Gia Ngu or another food store in the same stress. \nIt's wonderful that after work, we has good foods, drink a glass of apricot juice and don't worry about being out of phone battery, if you forgot the charger at home :-))\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2018",
